{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Follow my voice. Trust my guidance.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do you want to see our god? My friend, you\u2019ve come to the right place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296450/extras/QQ202534-18031.gif?t=1743774638\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I am merely a messenger, and I invite you to step onto the path of salvation. Just follow my lead. At the end of your journey, <strong>our gracious god will be waiting\u2014behind The Window 8.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296450/extras/QQ20250327-212323.png?t=1743774638\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this show, you are no longer the bystander, you are the star!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296450/extras/QQ202534-175615.gif?t=1743774638\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Oh, and as a welcome gift, we\u2019ve got a little something for you. A game we all love\u2014<strong>Symphony of Pots and Pans.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019ll enjoy it. <strong>You have to.</strong> After all, no one else will welcome you like we do. No one else will treat you like family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296450/extras/\u5f02\u53d8\u6e38\u620f.png?t=1743774638\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And we also have a little dinosaur. It runs and runs and runs...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Please ignore that last part. It\u2019s just a bug in the program. Nothing more. Nothing... intentional.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296450/extras/b7a606b2778451940af590489583299f.png?t=1743774638\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Add it to your wishlist!Add it to your wishlist!Add it to your wishlist!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3296450?t=1743774638","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3296450?t=1743774638","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296450/799673a8113705851f82d87894c4d26e39598b49/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743774638","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296450/799673a8113705851f82d87894c4d26e39598b49/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743774638","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3591310,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Follow my voice. Trust my guidance.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do you want to see our god? My friend, you\u2019ve come to the right place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296450/extras/QQ202534-18031.gif?t=1743774638\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I am merely a messenger, and I invite you to step onto the path of salvation. Just follow my lead. At the end of your journey, <strong>our gracious god will be waiting\u2014behind The Window 8.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296450/extras/QQ20250327-212323.png?t=1743774638\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this show, you are no longer the bystander, you are the star!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296450/extras/QQ202534-175615.gif?t=1743774638\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Oh, and as a welcome gift, we\u2019ve got a little something for you. A game we all love\u2014<strong>Symphony of Pots and Pans.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019ll enjoy it. <strong>You have to.</strong> After all, no one else will welcome you like we do. No one else will treat you like family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296450/extras/\u5f02\u53d8\u6e38\u620f.png?t=1743774638\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And we also have a little dinosaur. It runs and runs and runs...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Please ignore that last part. It\u2019s just a bug in the program. Nothing more. Nothing... intentional.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296450/extras/b7a606b2778451940af590489583299f.png?t=1743774638\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Add it to your wishlist!Add it to your wishlist!Add it to your wishlist!</p>","developers":["MonsterMoonLight"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3296450/869fc6c4d31f1d3049579d8c80cf96d5e87d6a80/header.jpg?t=1743774638","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257118587,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118587/movie480.mp4?t=1743732049","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118587/movie_max.mp4?t=1743732049"},"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/